  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.skenas_katalambanousai.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.skenas_katalambanousai.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai"><head>ΣΚΗΝΑΣ ΚΑΤΑΛΑΜΒΑΝΟΥΣΑΙ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(1.) Scholiasta Platonis Clarkianus, p. 330 ed. Bekker.</note>
            <quote>Ἀριστοφάνης – ἐκωμῳδείτο ἐπὶ τῷ σκώπτειν μὲν Εὐριπίδην, μιμεῖσθαι δ᾽ αὐτόν. καὶ αὐτὸς δ᾽ ἐξομολογεῖται Σκηνὰς καταλαμβανούσαις</quote>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Χρῶμαι γὰρ αὐτοῦ (φησὶ) τοῦ στόματος τῷ</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">στρογγύλῳ,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">τοὺς νοῦς δ᾽ ἀγοραίους ἧττον ἢ ἐκεῖνος ποιῶ.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="apparatus">V. 2. νοῦς ἀγοραίους] Bekkeri Anecd. I, p. 339, 10. Priora Aristophanis verba attulit Plutarchus Moral. p. 30 d.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(2.) Photius p. 340, 22.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ μὴν ἄκουσον, ὦ γύναι, θυμοῦ δίχα</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">καὶ κρῖνον αὐτὴ μὴ μετ᾽ ὀξυρεγμίας.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(3.) Pollux X, 67.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Λήκυθον</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">τὴν ἑπτακότυλον, τὴν χυτραίαν, τὴν καλὴν,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">ἣν ἐφερόμην, ἵν᾽ ἔχοιμι συνθεάτριαν.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="apparatus">V. 3. συνθεάτριαν ex Aristophane affert Pollux IV, 121. Idem VI, 158. Συνθεάτριαν δὲ καὶ συλλῄστριαν καὶ σύγκοιτον Ἀριστοφάνης εἶπεν. et II, 56. Καὶ θεάτρια καὶ συνθεάτρια ἡ παλαιὰ κωμῳδία. Quibus addimus cognata ex IV, 106. Πρόσχορον δὲ Ἀριστοφάνης τὴν χορεύουσαν κέκληκε, τὴν δ᾽ αὐτὴν καὶ συγχορεύτριαν.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(4.) Athenæus VII, p. 287 a.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀλλ᾽ ἔχουσα γαστέρα</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">μεστὴν βοάκων ἀπεβάδιζον οἴκαδε.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(5.) Pollux VII, 157.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ τῶν πλατυλόγχων διβολίαν ἀκοντίων.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="apparatus">Idem X, 144. propter vocabulum πλατυλόγχων hunc versum afferens diversam præbet scripturam Καὶ τῶν πλατυλόγχων, ὡς ὁρᾶς, ἀκοντίων.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-6" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(6.) Pollux VII, 202.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Τὴν πύρδαλιν καλοῦσι τὴν κασαλβάδα.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="7" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-7" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(7.) Athenæus IV, p. 169 c. et Pollux 106.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Τὴν κακκάβην γὰρ κᾶε τοῦ διδασκάλου.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="8" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-8" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(8.) Pollux X, 114.</note>
            <quote>Ὥσπερ κόσκινον αἰρόπινον τέτρηται.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="9" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-9" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(9.) Pollux X, 147.</note>
            <quote>Τοίχον μοχλίσκῳ καταβαλεῖν.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="10" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-10" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(10.) Scholiasta Equitum v. 422.</note>
            <quote>Ἀλλὰ συσπάσαι δεῖ τὰς κοχώνας.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="11" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-11" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(11.) Hesychius, Οὐ γὰρ ἄκανθαι: παροιμία.</note>
            <quote>Ἀριστοφάνης Σκηνὰς καταλαμβανούσαις Οὐδ᾽ ἴσως ἀντέλεγες τούτῳ τῷ δειπνίῳ· οὐ γὰρ ἄκανθαι.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="12" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-12" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(12.) Pollux X, 28.</note>
            <quote>Τὸ κόρημα καλεῖται τὸ κορούμενον ἐν Σκηνὰς καταλαμβανούσαις Ἀριστοφάνους.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="13" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-13" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(13.) Photius p. 404, 20.</note>
            <quote>Πεζίδα: τὴν ὤαν τοῦ ἱματίου. Ἀριστοφάνης Σκηνὰς καταλαμβανούσαις.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="14" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-14" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(14.) Pollux X, 172.</note>
            <quote>Τὴν δὲ πήραν πηρίδιον εἴποις ἂν, ὡς ἐν Σκηνὰς καταλαμβανούσαις Ἀριστοφάνης.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="15" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-15" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(15.) Hesychius, Τριτοστάτης: Ἀριστοφάνης ἐν Σκηναῖς.</note>
            <note type="commentary">Corrige Τριτοστάτις. Pollux IV, 106. Καὶ τὴν γυναῖκα δὲ τριτοστάτιν Ἀριστοφάνης καλεῖ.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="16" xml:id="fragment-skenas_katalambanousai-dindorf1893_grc1-16" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_skenas_katalambanousai">
            <note type="source">(16.) Harpocratio, Δήμαρχος: – ὅτι δὲ ἡνεχυρίαζον οἱ δήμαρχοι δηλοῖ Ἀριστοφάνης ἐν Σκηνὰς καταλαμβανούσαις.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
